OL,3,AHurricane Isaias strengthens to
OL,4,Acategory three as evacuations orders
OL,5,Aissued along US Gulf Coast
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurricane Isaias has strengthened to a
OL,8,F"major" category three storm as it
OL,9,Fbarrels towards the US Gulf Coast
OL,11,FThe latest data from aircraft tracking
OL,12,Fthe hurricane shows it now has
OL,13,Fsustained wind speeds of 120mph
OL,14,F(193km/h), with even higher gusts
OL,16,FIsaias, the first hurricane of the
OL,17,FAtlantic season, is forecast to weaken
OL,18,Fslightly before making landfall in the
OL,19,Fearly hours of Saturday morning
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
