OL,3,AHurricane Isaias strengthens to
OL,4,Acategory three as evacuations orders
OL,5,Aissued along US Gulf Coast
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's also expected to bring storm surge
OL,8,Fand heavy rain to parts of Mississippi,
OL,9,FAlabama and Florida - evacuation orders
OL,10,Fare already in place for some living in
OL,11,Fthose coastal communities
OL,13,FStates of emergency have also been
OL,14,Fissued in parts of Alabama, Florida and
OL,15,Fin all of Georgia
OL,17,FWhat about airports, railways and
OL,18,Froads? Some Florida airports are
OL,19,Fscheduled to close ahead of landfall,
OL,20,Fwhile Amtrak services in parts of
OL,21,FLouisiana and Alabama are also
OL,22,Fdisrupted
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
